\section{Workflow Provenance}
This analysis was performed using the standard Codex analysis pipeline, which was adapted to the raw data directory for this project. After an initial attempt using a small model failed, the user-authorized standard Codex analysis code was reused, with only the raw data path adjusted. All statistics and figures were regenerated from independently downloaded raw matrices, without copying any reference results, figures, or PDFs. The methods.tex and results.tex files were directly revised by the supervisor based on prior feedback. All subsequent writing, modification, and compilation of the report will be executed by project-integrated Qwen3.5-4B tools; the supervisor will review and provide feedback. This work does not claim complete independent creation by a small model, nor does it assert Codex-equivalent reasoning. The report has not yet been submitted to arXiv.
